>> asciidoc-research.adoc  :: "Research template — findings, analysis, citations"
>> asciidoc-index.adoc     :: "Index template — navigation hubs, table of contents"
>> asciidoc-community.adoc :: "Community template — README, CONTRIBUTING, welcome docs"
